---
description: Go domain-error and snippet-marker conventions in this repo
globs:
  - "*.go"
---

Domain errors are small struct types with an `Error()` method, matching the
existing banking errors such as `InsufficientFundsError` and
`InvalidAccountError` in `banking-client.go`. Prefer that shape over bare
`errors.New` when introducing a typed failure callers may need to recognise.

Preserve `@@@SNIPSTART` / `@@@SNIPEND` markers. They bound excerpts for docs
and templates; do not remove, rename, or wrap them casually when editing.
